{"id": "91e18a7e-c60d-4f26-81eb-eb77d1e48be6", "slug": "orbital-operations-center", "title": "Orbital Operations Center", "description": "Orbital Operations Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Orbital Operations Center\"\ndescription: \"Orbital Operations Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FF7A59\"\n  secondary: \"#1A1A1A\"\n  accent: \"#FF896B\"\n  background: \"#171717\"\n  surface: \"#1A1A1A\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#CBE1CC\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Orbital Operations Center\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 19; favorites: 11; remixes: 2.\nTags: section, css, layout, content, responsive.\n## Overview\nOrbital Operations Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nI D350 Orbital Operations Center Global Mission Archive Log: 18.04.2035 0 Total Missions Chapter 1 • 290 Pages → 0 Deep Probes Chapter 2 • 325 Pages →\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Orbital Operations Center; Global Mission Archive.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FF7A59, secondary #1A1A1A, accent #FF896B, background #171717, surface #1A1A1A, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Orbital Operations Center</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#171717] min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center font-sans antialiased selection:bg-black/20 overflow-hidden m-0 relative\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL 3D Object Background -->\n    <canvas id=\"webgl-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none opacity-40\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Structural Container Lines Framework -->\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none flex items-center justify-center p-4 sm:p-8\">\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-[1200px] h-[700px] relative\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 bottom-0 left-0 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-white/10 to-transparent\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 bottom-0 right-0 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-white/10 to-transparent\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute left-0 right-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/10 to-transparent\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute left-0 right-0 bottom-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/10 to-transparent\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Corner Mini Squares -->\n            <div class=\"absolute -top-1 -left-1 w-2 h-2 border border-white/20 bg-[#171717] z-10\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -top-1 -right-1 w-2 h-2 border border-white/20 bg-[#171717] z-10\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -bottom-1 -left-1 w-2 h-2 border border-white/20 bg-[#171717] z-10\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -bottom-1 -right-1 w-2 h-2 border border-white/20 bg-[#171717] z-10\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Dashboard Widget -->\n    <div class=\"w-full max-w-[1200px] mx-auto relative z-10 p-4 sm:p-8 animate-[fadeIn_1s_ease-out]\">\n\n        <!-- Premium Border Gradient Wrapper -->\n        <div class=\"relative rounded-sm bg-gradient-to-br from-white/10 via-white/[0.02] to-transparent p-[2px] shadow-[0_40px_80px_-20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)]\">\n\n            <!-- Inner Swiss Grid Interface -->\n            <div class=\"relative w-full bg-[#1A1A1A] flex flex-col md:grid md:grid-cols-[1.5fr_1fr] border-[2px] border-[#1A1A1A] overflow-hidden\">\n\n                <!-- Left Panel: Main Info -->\n                <div class=\"bg-[#CBE1CC] relative p-8 md:p-12 lg:p-16 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[400px] md:min-h-[600px] border-b-[2px] md:border-b-0 md:border-r-[2px] border-[#1A1A1A] overflow-hidden group\">\n\n                    <!-- SVG Geometric Background -->\n                    <svg class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none opacity-30 mix-blend-multiply\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\">\n                        <line x1=\"300\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"1000\" stroke=\"#1A1A1A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" />\n                        <line x1=\"600\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"600\" y2=\"1000\" stroke=\"#1A1A1A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" />\n                        <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"350\" x2=\"1000\" y2=\"350\" stroke=\"#1A1A1A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" />\n                        <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"750\" x2=\"1000\" y2=\"750\" stroke=\"#1A1A1A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" />\n                        <circle cx=\"600\" cy=\"550\" r=\"300\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1A1A1A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" />\n                        <line x1=\"300\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1000\" y2=\"700\" stroke=\"#1A1A1A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" />\n                        <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"800\" r=\"400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1A1A1A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" />\n                    </svg>\n\n                    <!-- Header / Logo -->\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10 flex items-center gap-3 mb-16\">\n                        <!-- Custom Hex Logo -->\n                        <svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" class=\"text-[#1A1A1A]\">\n                            <g fill=\"currentColor\">\n                                <polygon points=\"20,2 26,5 26,11 20,14 14,11 14,5\" />\n                                <polygon points=\"12,15 18,18 18,24 12,27 6,24 6,18\" />\n                                <polygon points=\"28,15 34,18 34,24 28,27 22,24 22,18\" />\n                                <polygon points=\"20,28 26,31 26,37 20,40 14,37 14,31\" />\n                                <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20.5\" r=\"3\" />\n                            </g>\n                        </svg>\n                        <span class=\"text-xl font-semibold tracking-widest text-[#1A1A1A]\">I D350</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Titles -->\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10 mt-auto mb-16\">\n                        <h1 class=\"text-6xl sm:text-7xl md:text-8xl lg:text-9xl font-semibold tracking-tighter text-[#1A1A1A] leading-[0.9] mb-6\">\n                            <div class=\"overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"animate-[slideUp_0.8s_cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)]\">Orbital</div></div>\n                            <div class=\"overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"animate-[slideUp_0.8s_cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)_0.1s_both]\">Operations</div></div>\n                            <div class=\"overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"animate-[slideUp_0.8s_cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)_0.2s_both]\">Center</div></div>\n                        </h1>\n                        <h2 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#1A1A1A] animate-[fadeIn_1s_ease-out_0.5s_both]\">Global Mission Archive</h2>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Footer Data -->\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10 flex items-center gap-4 animate-[fadeIn_1s_ease-out_0.7s_both]\">\n                        <div class=\"w-16 h-[6px] bg-[#1A1A1A]\"></div>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-[#1A1A1A] uppercase\">Log: 18.04.2035</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Right Panels -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col h-full\">\n\n                    <!-- Top Right Block -->\n                    <div class=\"flex-1 bg-[#FF7A59] p-8 md:p-12 border-b-[2px] border-[#1A1A1A] flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden group hover:bg-[#ff896b] transition-colors duration-500\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-12\">\n                            <div>\n                                <div class=\"text-7xl sm:text-8xl font-semibold tracking-tighter text-[#1A1A1A] leading-none mb-2 number-counter\" data-target=\"251\">0</div>\n                                <div class=\"text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#1A1A1A]\">Total Missions</div>\n                            </div>\n                            <!-- Custom Slash Icon -->\n                            <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"text-[#1A1A1A] transform group-hover:rotate-12 transition-transform duration-500\">\n                                <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n                                <line x1=\"6\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" />\n                                <line x1=\"8\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"8\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" />\n                            </svg>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"mt-auto flex items-end justify-between border-t border-[#1A1A1A]/20 pt-4\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-[#1A1A1A] uppercase\">Chapter 1 • 290 Pages</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-[#1A1A1A] transform group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\">→</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Bottom Right Block -->\n                    <div class=\"flex-1 bg-[#5B635A] p-8 md:p-12 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden group hover:bg-[#656d64] transition-colors duration-500\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-12\">\n                            <div>\n                                <div class=\"text-7xl sm:text-8xl font-semibold tracking-tighter text-[#CBE1CC] leading-none mb-2 number-counter\" data-target=\"49\">0</div>\n                                <div class=\"text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#CBE1CC]\">Deep Probes</div>\n                            </div>\n                            <!-- Custom Crosshair Icon -->\n                            <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"text-[#CBE1CC] transform group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500\">\n                                <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"4\" r=\"2\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n                                <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n                                <circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n                                <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n                                <path d=\"M9 9l6 6M15 9l-6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"mt-auto flex items-end justify-between border-t border-[#CBE1CC]/20 pt-4\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-[#CBE1CC] uppercase\">Chapter 2 • 325 Pages</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-[#CBE1CC] transform group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\">→</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <style>\n        @keyframes slideUp {\n            from { transform: translateY(100%); opacity: 0; }\n            to { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; }\n        }\n        @keyframes fadeIn {\n            from { opacity: 0; }\n            to { opacity: 1; }\n        }\n    </style>\n\n    <script>\n        // Number Counter Animation\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            const counters = document.querySelectorAll('.number-counter');\n\n            counters.forEach(counter => {\n                const target = parseInt(counter.getAttribute('data-target'));\n                const duration = 2000;\n                let startTime = null;\n\n                const easeOutExpo = (t) => t === 1 ? 1 : 1 - Math.pow(2, -10 * t);\n\n                const updateCounter = (timestamp) => {\n                    if (!startTime) startTime = timestamp;\n                    const progress = Math.min((timestamp - startTime) / duration, 1);\n                    const easedProgress = easeOutExpo(progress);\n\n                    counter.innerText = Math.floor(easedProgress * target);\n\n                    if (progress < 1) {\n                        requestAnimationFrame(updateCounter);\n                    } else {\n                        counter.innerText = target;\n                    }\n                };\n\n                // Delay start slightly for effect\n                setTimeout(() => {\n                    requestAnimationFrame(updateCounter);\n                }, 500);\n            });\n        });\n\n        // WebGL 3D Object (Three.js)\n        const initWebGL = () => {\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('webgl-canvas');\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\n            // Camera setup for depth\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(45, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n            camera.position.z = 15;\n            camera.position.x = 5; // Offset to the right\n\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas, alpha: true, antialias: true });\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n\n            // Geometric Mesh: Icosahedron for faceted look\n            const geometry = new THREE.IcosahedronGeometry(4, 0); // Radius 4, Detail 0 (flat facets)\n\n            // Physically Based Material\n            const material = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\n                color: 0x444444,\n                roughness: 0.2,\n                metalness: 0.8,\n                wireframe: false,\n                flatShading: true // Highlights the geometric facets\n            });\n\n            const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material);\n            scene.add(mesh);\n\n            // Add wireframe overlay for tech aesthetic\n            const wireframeMaterial = new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({ color: 0x666666, transparent: true, opacity: 0.2 });\n            const wireframe = new THREE.LineSegments(new THREE.WireframeGeometry(geometry), wireframeMaterial);\n            mesh.add(wireframe);\n\n            // Dynamic Lighting\n            const ambientLight = new THREE.AmbientLight(0xffffff, 0.5);\n            scene.add(ambientLight);\n\n            const dirLight1 = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff, 1);\n            dirLight1.position.set(5, 5, 5);\n            scene.add(dirLight1);\n\n            const dirLight2 = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xff896b, 0.5); // Orange rim light\n            dirLight2.position.set(-5, -5, -5);\n            scene.add(dirLight2);\n\n            // Animation Loop\n            let time = 0;\n            const animate = () => {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n\n                time += 0.005;\n\n                // Subtle rotation\n                mesh.rotation.x = time * 0.5;\n                mesh.rotation.y = time * 0.8;\n\n                // Floating motion\n                mesh.position.y = Math.sin(time * 2) * 0.5;\n\n                // Mouse interaction (subtle parallax)\n                mesh.rotation.x += (mouseY - mesh.rotation.x) * 0.05;\n                mesh.rotation.y += (mouseX - mesh.rotation.y) * 0.05;\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            };\n\n            // Mouse tracking for subtle parallax\n            let mouseX = 0;\n            let mouseY = 0;\n            document.addEventListener('mousemove', (event) => {\n                mouseX = (event.clientX / window.innerWidth) * 0.5 - 0.25;\n                mouseY = (event.clientY / window.innerHeight) * 0.5 - 0.25;\n            });\n\n            // Handle Resize\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            });\n\n            animate();\n        };\n\n        // Initialize WebGL if Three.js loaded\n        if (typeof THREE !== 'undefined') {\n            initWebGL();\n        }\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "orbital-operations-center.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/orbital-operations-center.jpg", "source_name": "orbital-operations-center-DESIGN.md", "views": 188, "forks": 13, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T08:55:25.223794+00:00"}